### 상품 등록 테스트
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "기계식 키보드",
  "description": "사용 기간 3개월",
  "price": 50000,
  "tags": ["키보드", "전자기기"]
}

### 상품 가격 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 45000
}


### 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/1

### 게시글 전체 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/articles

### 페이지네이션 테스트
GET http://localhost:3000/articles?offset=0&limit=5

### 검색 테스트
GET http://localhost:3000/articles?keyword=안녕


### 게시글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "첫 번째 게시글",
  "content": "Prisma와 PostgreSQL로 작성한 게시글입니다."
}


### 게시글 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/1

### 존재하지 않는 게시글
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/999

### 잘못된 게시글 ID
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/abc

### 게시글 제목 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/articles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "수정된 게시글 제목"
}

### 게시글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/articles/1


### 상품 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "아직 판매 중인가요?"
}

### 존재하지 않는 상품에 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/products/99999/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "구매 가능한가요?"
}

### 내용이 없는 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": ""
}


### 상품 댓글 첫 페이지
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments?limit=2

### 상품 댓글 다음 페이지
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments?limit=2&cursor=4

### 존재하지 않는 상품의 댓글 조회
GET http://localhost:3000/products/99999/comments

### 잘못된 커서
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments?cursor=abc


### 상품 댓글 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "가격을 조금 할인해 주실 수 있나요?"
}

### 존재하지 않는 댓글 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "수정 테스트"
}

### 빈 댓글 내용으로 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": ""
}


### 상품 댓글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments/3

### 이미 삭제한 댓글 다시 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments/3

### 잘못된 댓글 ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments/abc


### 게시글 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "좋은 정보 감사합니다!"
}

### 존재하지 않는 게시글에 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/articles/99999/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "댓글 테스트"
}

### 빈 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": ""
}


### 게시글 댓글 첫 페이지
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments?limit=2

### 게시글 댓글 다음 페이지
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments?limit=2&cursor=4

### 존재하지 않는 게시글
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/99999/comments

### 잘못된 커서
GET http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments?cursor=abc


### 게시글 댓글 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "수정된 댓글입니다."
}

### 존재하지 않는 댓글 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "수정 테스트"
}

### 빈 댓글 내용으로 수정
PATCH http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": ""
}

### 잘못된 댓글 ID
PATCH http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments/abc
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "수정 테스트"
}

### 게시글 댓글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments/3

### 삭제된 댓글 다시 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments/3

### 잘못된 댓글 ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/articles/1/comments/abc


### Cascade 테스트용 상품 생성
POST http://localhost:3000/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cascade 테스트 상품",
  "description": "삭제 테스트용 상품입니다.",
  "price": 1000,
  "tags": ["test"]
}

### 테스트 상품에 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Cascade 테스트 댓글입니다."
}

### 댓글 목록 확인
GET http://localhost:3000/products/1/comments

### 테스트 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:3000/products/1